comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-21T05:41:50.945Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check 2026-08-21: searched all 2,526 PM items and repository history for allow-scripts, EALLOWSCRIPTS, isolated install, and GitHub #1072; no canonical item existed. Source: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1072"
  "2026-08-21T17:06:12.222Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence: focused contract suite passed (9 files, 64 tests); pnpm build, TypeScript public type tests, and full ESLint passed. Full repository gates and packed-runtime acceptance are next."
  "2026-08-21T17:45:41.433Z","harness:codex","Final evidence: SDK install execution now removes ambient npm_config_allow_scripts case-insensitively and supplies an empty NPM_CONFIG_ALLOW_SCRIPTS while preserving the caller environment; --ignore-scripts remains mandatory. Linked test passed (10/10). Manual fresh tarball acceptance passed through both npx and bunx with NPM_CONFIG_ALLOW_SCRIPTS=packed-safe-service-package while installing an npm: local package with runtime dependencies. Full suite passed 551 files / 7702 tests at exact 100% statements, branches, functions, and lines; package artifact, audit, secret, static-quality, and zero-duplication gates passed."
  "2026-08-21T17:49:37.480Z","harness:codex","Governance evidence correction: classified as production_defect and bound the fix to its executable negative-control test, local packed/full/static gates, and hosted static/coverage owners; no waiver used."
  "2026-08-21T18:47:51.912Z","harness:codex","PR review remediation evidence: mixed-case allow-scripts isolation and unrelated-environment preservation passed in focused run test-local-mt3amyla-r17evz (10/10). Replayable package artifact, production audit, and secret scan passed in run test-local-mt3awb8c-sq3zw3. CHANGELOG.md is linked as reviewed delivery documentation."
